# Detection Logic Explanation

This project uses basic SOC detection principles:

## 1. Event Monitoring
Tracks all Windows Security events for visibility.

## 2. User Extraction
Uses regex to extract "Account Name" from raw logs due to inconsistent field mapping.

## 3. Activity Analysis
Aggregates events by user and host to identify patterns.

## 4. Anomaly Detection
Identifies users with unusually high activity counts.

## Limitations
- No CIM normalization applied
- Raw log parsing required
- Limited threat intelligence enrichment
